@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@access_token = paste_current_access_token_here
@refresh_token = paste_current_refresh_token_here

### Register (synthetic local-only input)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"swagger@example.test","password":"SyntheticPassword!2026","display_name":"Swagger"}

### Login (capture tokens in memory / your HTTP client, never commit them)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"swagger@example.test","password":"SyntheticPassword!2026"}

### Profile via Gateway
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Rotate; replace BOTH token variables from response
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"{{refresh_token}}"}

### Logout matching current pair
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"{{refresh_token}}"}
